WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Tuberculosis: does everyone really need 6 months of treatment?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
TRUNCATE-TB randomized 674 participants adults with drug-susceptible TB.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Week-96 primary outcome: 5.8% with the bedaquiline-linezolid strategy versus 3.9% with standard treatment.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Difference 0.8 percentage points, inside the 12 percentage points margin. Noninferior.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Total treatment time: 85 days versus 180 days.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
The 8-week bedaquiline-linezolid strategy was noninferior. N Engl J Med, 2023. Scroll for the full breakdown.
